{
 "family": "qwen3_5",
 "about": "Qwen3.5's hybrid decoder: a per-layer token mixer that is either full attention (per-head q/k RMSNorm, doubled q_proj split into query + output gate, partial half-split RoPE, GQA, causal mask) or Gated DeltaNet linear attention (causal conv1d, gated delta recurrence, gated RMSNorm), then a zero-centered RMSNorm + SwiGLU MLP. RoPE theta/partial factor live under rope_parameters.",
 "match": {
  "model_type": [
   "qwen3_5",
   "qwen3_5_text"
  ]
 },
 "verified": {
  "transformers": "5.18.0",
  "date": "2026-10-06",
  "by": "reverse-model agent",
  "check": "tests/spec_conformance_test.py qwen3_5",
  "note": "embedding, full-attention q/k/v projections, every block output and the logits match the eager library run (max|diff| <= 3e-08; the full-attention projections are 0.0). The tiny gate config carries both layer types (['full_attention', 'linear_attention']), so the linear_attention branch is exercised too: its causal conv1d + gated delta rule (in_proj_qkv/z/b/a, conv1d, A_log+dt_bias, gated RMSNorm, out_proj) runs in the torch engine and its block output matches. The scan node binds HF's raw `A_log` and is marked `a_log`, so the decay is `-exp(A_log) * softplus(a + dt)`; a GGUF's `ssm_a` (already `-exp(A_log)`) is bound unchanged. This family spec covers the language decoder of a multimodal Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration; block params bind both the plain `model.layers.{i}.` and the multimodal `model.language_model.layers.{i}.` prefixes. For Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B the vision tower (model.visual.*, 333 tensors) and the MTP head (mtp.*, 15 tensors) stay unbound; on the NVFP4 variants the quant metadata (*_scale/*_global_scale) and the packed MLP weights stay unbound / bind the weight_packed candidate. Cloudflare/clef is a Qwen3.8-27B finetune whose backbone binds identically under `model.language_model.*` (1184 tensors; 851 bound, audit clean, 1976 boxes); its 333 vision-tower tensors (model.visual.*) and its separate custom joint schema head (joint_head.safetensors, not part of the HF model) stay unbound. simonlehmann/clef-NVFP4 is the llm-compressor mixed-precision quant of Cloudflare/clef sharing that layout: 1920 tensors, 851 bound, 1976 boxes, audit clean. Its MLP layers 0-55 bind the packed `mlp.{gate,up,down}_proj.weight_packed` (u8, two weights/byte), layers 56-63 bind the FP8 `mlp.*.weight` (f8_e4m3), and the full-/linear-attention projections bind their f8_e4m3 `weight`; the `*_scale`/`*_global_scale`/`input_global_scale` quant metadata, the 333 model.visual.* tensors and joint_head.safetensors stay unbound. lm_head binds model-00002 lm_head.weight (bf16, untied)."
 },
